{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/15","id":4481842531,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUAdvbc8AAAABCyN9Yw","html_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pull/15","diff_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pull/15.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pull/15.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/issues/15","number":15,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix: fail closed on incomplete protection and skipped REST pages","user":{"login":"danny0971haha","id":202909309,"node_id":"U_kgDODBgmfQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/202909309?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha","html_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The published PR14 collector can claim complete coverage when a REST protection response has an empty administrator-enforcement object, or when REST pagination skips a numbered page. Both cases were reproduced against `12d04d82d0a2b02240619633b3264c77eb1754c9` despite its existing 60 tests passing.\n\nThis stacked correction requires a boolean `enforce_admins.enabled` and a contiguous next page. Confirmed observations remain available when coverage becomes partial. It adds three regression methods and changes only the collector and new evidence.\n\n- Base: PR14 `12d04d82d0a2b02240619633b3264c77eb1754c9`, tree `1b176e67b4a398450f26bbf1544ebb7757846dcb`.\n- Tool checkpoint: `2f71dd048f49a3218c55cf9876363ccd8741ea1a`, tree `24bf08e926ae77d79a6e5ce06c782dbab5e6e55f`.\n- Published candidate: `26e19416585d173ac1ba3b53d338c52c646f983f`, tree `b91528e8626f13b38d0b1f5f69a3df61d937a7a9`.\n- Validation: 63 Python unittest methods passed at the code checkpoint; staged diff check, scoped format and secret scan passed. Original failing regression output is retained losslessly. Exact published-head rerun is recorded in the closeout receipt; ordinary CI is not a Python-test substitute.\n\n[18-section evidence packet](https://github.com/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/blob/26e19416585d173ac1ba3b53d338c52c646f983f/docs/evidence/protection-completeness-20260909/EVIDENCE.md)\n\nThe existing acquisition/repack remains untouched. Its saved responses do not contain either new defect. Acquisition, repack, old final tool version, and this new tested version remain separate. No full network collection was repeated. Original PR14 and PR13 heads remain unchanged.\n\nIndependent review is pending. No merge, deployment, settings/ruleset change, baseline rebind, frozen-ref move, exchange credential access, exchange networking/write, or new runtime phase. No acceptance or trading authorization is declared.\n","created_at":"2026-09-09T06:25:57Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T06:25:57Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"d7988c315fe1f0de125803060886ac269f179d2e","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/15/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/15/comments","review